  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "土木與景觀遊憩之跨領域對話",
    "sub_ename": "INTERDISCIPLINARY DIALOGUE BETWEEN CIVIL ENGINEERING AND LANDSCAPE RECREATION",
    "describe_ch": "跨領域課程已經成為台灣各級學校培育人才的發展重點。更也是教育部高教深耕計畫的重要指標之一。土木工程和景觀遊憩之間的跨領域對話至關重要。這種合作有助於綜合城市空間的設計，確保基礎設施、公共空間和綠化協調一致。同時，它有助於提高生態可持續性，關注水資源管理和生態保護。景觀遊憩增加了文化和休閒價值，創建有吸引力的環境，但必須與土木工程結合，以確保安全性。",
    "describe_eh": "Interdisciplinary courses have become a focal point in nurturing talent at all levels of education in Taiwan. They are also an important indicator of the Ministry of Education's Higher Education Deep Cultivation Plan. Interdisciplinary dialogue between civil engineering and landscape recreation is crucial. This collaboration contributes to the integrated design of urban spaces, ensuring the coherence of infrastructure, public spaces, and greenery. Moreover, it aids in enhancing ecological sustainability, with a focus on water resource management and ecological conservation. Landscape recreation enhances cultural and leisure value by creating attractive environments but must be integrated with civil engineering to ensure safety.",
    "pre_subname": "",
